config FINGERPRINT_GOODIX_3626
	tristate "Goodix 3626 fingerprint sensor platform driver"
	depends on INPUT_FINGERPRINT
	help
	  Platform driver for the Goodix 3626 side-mounted fingerprint
	  sensor used on the Xiaomi marble (POCO F5 / Redmi Note 12 Turbo).

	  It exposes the downstream /dev/goodix_fp character device, the
	  Goodix netlink events and the input device used by the vendor HAL.
	  Fingerprint matching itself is performed by the vendor TEE
	  application.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.  The module will
	  be called goodix_3626.
